   "voiceId": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
   "durationS": 15,
   "text": "The tracks set the rhythm. The world outside supplies the stories. This is a simulated ride. Welcome aboard. We're riding the California Zephyr. This stretch: The Rockies. As we travel, we'll discover the stories behind places along the way.",
   "language": "en"
  },
  "f965c3b1906e5e45": {
   "url": "/audio/demo/b35233479da8ed06.mp3",
   "voiceId": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
   "durationS": 18,
   "text": "Las vías marcan el ritmo. El mundo de fuera pone las historias. Este es un viaje simulado. Te damos la bienvenida a bordo. Viajamos en el California Zephyr. Este tramo: The Rockies. Por el camino descubriremos las historias de los lugares que pasamos.",
   "language": "es"
  },
  "39ef148d6e128c78": {
   "url": "/audio/demo/7cbd233b513d8623.mp3",
   "voiceId": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
   "durationS": 16,
   "text": "铁轨打着节拍，窗外的世界讲着故事。 这是一次模拟旅程。 欢迎上车。 我们乘坐的是California Zephyr。本段路程：The Rockies。 一路上，我们将发现沿途地点背后的故事。",
   "language": "zh-CN"
  },
